                                "example_id": "1a3c5bbb-ba42-4b82-aa84-ef078e49347a",
                                "sense_id": "f79d05a0-662b-3acd-929a-526bd260cb9e",
                                "text": "\"Anti-Antifa\" ist die Bezeichnung für eine seit Jahren von Neonazis betriebene, bundesweite Kampagne der \"Feindaufklärung\".",
                                "translation": "\"Anti-Antifa\" is the designation of a \"know-your-enemy\" campaign pursued for years by neo-Nazis throughout Germany.",
                                "english": "\"Anti-Antifa\" is the designation of a \"know-your-enemy\" campaign pursued for years by neo-Nazis throughout Germany."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d89cc426-04bd-432c-96fc-7db6e8c130b3",
                                "sense_id": "f79d05a0-662b-3acd-929a-526bd260cb9e",
                                "text": "Sicherheitsexperten nennen die Anti-Antifa eine \"Feierabend-Gestapo\".",
                                "translation": "Security experts call Anti-Antifa an \"after-hours Gestapo\".",
                                "english": "Security experts call Anti-Antifa an \"after-hours Gestapo\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ca6fb11-4cad-4b28-bba1-20ea427238e1",
                                "sense_id": "f79d05a0-662b-3acd-929a-526bd260cb9e",
                                "text": "Auch in Ostthüringen bildet sich daraufhin eine »Anti-Antifa«, im Sommer 1995 registriert der Verfassungsschutz erstmals Uwe Mundlos als Aktivisten.",
                                "translation": "An \"Anti-Antifa\" also took shape then in East Thuringia; in the summer of 1995, the Federal Office for the Protection of the Constitution registered Uwe Mundlos as an activist.",
